NAME
    wmsysinfo - live system info dashboard (Path C phase 22)

SYNOPSIS
    wmsysinfo [SECONDS]

DESCRIPTION
    Open a 400x260 window showing live kernel diagnostics
    refreshed every 500 ms:

      pid                 wmsysinfo's own pid
      current cpu         which CPU this poll ran on
      sys_time (epoch s)  kernel-corrected wall clock
      wmsysinfo uptime s  seconds since the program started
      heap brk            current sys_brk pointer (hex)
      framebuffer         WxH @ Nbpp (from sys_fb_info)
      cpu 0..3            per-CPU sched-tick counters
                          (from sys_smp_stats)

    Press q / Q / Esc to quit.  Also closes via the WM's red X.

SEE ALSO
    wmd(1), wmfiles(1), wmclock(1)
